OL,3,GNEWSAVillages get share of #50m flood
OL,4,Adefence fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trio of villages have secured a share
OL,7,Fof #50m from central government to help
OL,8,Fcombat flooding.
OL,10,FThe Three Villages Flood Group (3VFG),
OL,11,Fwhich covers Ashington, Chilton Cantelo
OL,12,Fand Mudford near Yeovil in Somerset,
OL,13,Fsaid it is one of the groups
OL,14,Fbenefitting from #10m of the funding.
OL,16,FThe Department for the Environment,
OL,17,FFood and Rural Affairs (Defra) provided
OL,18,Ffunding in early-June for "flood
OL,19,Fresilience" projects in the aftermath
OL,20,Fof Storm Chandra, which caused
OL,21,Fsignificant disruption across Somerset
OL,22,Fthroughout the winter.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
